{"a":[90,90],"h":"<p>Bu söz, muhatabların gönüllerinde anî bir şimşek gibi parlamıştı ki derhal onun Yusüf olduğuna intikal ederek kemali hayret ve heyecan ile kekelercesine 90.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"212\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 212.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 34.6 45.8 54.0 54.0 69.8 86.3 86.3 93.0 114.0 130.6 130.6 137.3 137.3 144.0 159.8 166.6 166.6 174.8 174.8 182.3 189.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.6 69.8 93.0 97.6 114.0 130.6 144.0 189.0 195.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> a... senmisin sahih sen Yusüf ? dediler - o da kendini ve kardeşini ta'rif ve takdim ile tebşir ederek: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 139.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 34.6 45.7 54.0 54.0 69.7 76.6 76.6 83.3 99.0 109.6 116.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.6 76.6 83.3 99.0 116.3 123.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ben, dedi, Yusüfüm<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"66\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 65.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 32.3 32.3 41.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 41.3 49.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bu ya'ni yanımda mevki'i ıkbalde bulunan ve nazarı dikkatinizden kaçmış gibi görünen zat da<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"63\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 39.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 39.7 46.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kardeşim - ve bundan gurur ve tefahur hıssi anlaşılmamak için Allaha şükür ve tahdisi ni'met ile nasıhat makamında şu cümleleri ilâve etti :<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 156.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 30.0 36.7 43.6 61.6 61.6 68.3 68.3 68.3 75.0 82.6 98.3 98.3 108.7 124.6 124.6 133.6\" y=\"26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 36.7 43.6 98.3 108.7 133.6 140.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hakikaten Allah, bizi in'amile memnun etti <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 24.0 30.7 30.7 45.0 51.7 69.0 69.0 79.6 79.6 86.3 102.0 102.0 112.6 128.3 128.3 135.0 135.0 141.7 141.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.0 51.7 79.6 86.3 112.6 135.0 148.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şuna şüphe yok ki her kim ittika ve sabrederse - fenalıktan sakınır ve mihnete sabr eylerse<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"277\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 276.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.8 33.8 40.6 52.6 52.6 65.3 65.3 74.3 74.3 81.8 97.6 105.0 105.0 117.0 132.8 132.8 141.8 148.6 148.6 162.8 162.8 178.6 199.6 206.3 206.3 206.3 213.0 220.6 236.3 236.3 246.8 246.8 253.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 40.6 97.6 117.0 183.0 199.6 236.3 253.6 260.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her halde Allah muhsinlerin ecrine zâyi' etmez. </p>"}